  "body": "Enjoy the relaxed coastal lifestyle that makes Orewa popular. Just minutes from Orewa Beach, this brand-new home combines everyday comfort, low-maintenance living, and an affordable price.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\n• 10-Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n\r\n• Approx. 336sqm section with a 167sqm (approx.) floor area\r\n\r\n• 4 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms, including a sunny master bedroom with ensuite\r\n\r\n• Light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area flowing seamlessly to the sunny deck\r\n\r\n• Well-appointed kitchen with a central island, quality appliances, and ample storage.\r\n\r\n• Easy-care section designed for low-maintenance living\r\n\r\n• Central air conditioning unit\r\n\r\nWith Orewa Beach, local amenities, and motorway access all within easy reach, this home offers the perfect balance of lifestyle and convenience.\r\n\r\nWhether you're buying your first home, downsizing, or investing, this affordable brand-new home is an opportunity not to be missed.\r\n\r\nContact us today for more information or to arrange a viewing.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
